---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { site, legal } from '../../config';
---

<Layout
  lang="en"
  title={`Privacy Policy · ${site.name}`}
  description="Privacy and Cookie Policy under the GDPR (EU 2016/679) and the Spanish LOPDGDD (Organic Law 3/2018)."
>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 sm:py-16 lg:px-12 lg:py-24">
    <p class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-clay sm:text-xs sm:tracking-[0.28em]">
      Data protection
    </p>
    <h1
      class="mt-4 font-display text-3xl leading-[1.1] text-ink sm:mt-6 sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl text-balance"
      style="font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 144, 'SOFT' 50;"
    >
      Privacy and Cookie Policy
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-taupe sm:text-base">
      In compliance with Regulation (EU) 2016/679 (GDPR) and the Spanish
      Organic Law 3/2018 of 5 December on the Protection of Personal Data and
      the guarantee of digital rights (LOPDGDD).
    </p>

    <div class="prose-legal mt-10 space-y-10 sm:mt-12 sm:space-y-12">
      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-ink sm:text-3xl" style="font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 72;">
          1. Data controller
        </h2>
        <dl class="mt-5 divide-y divide-line border-y border-line">
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-1 py-4 sm:grid-cols-[180px_1fr] sm:gap-4">
            <dt class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-taupe">Identity</dt>
            <dd class="text-base text-ink-soft">{legal.titular}</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-1 py-4 sm:grid-cols-[180px_1fr] sm:gap-4">
            <dt class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-taupe">NIE / NIF</dt>
            <dd class="text-base text-ink-soft">{legal.nif}</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-1 py-4 sm:grid-cols-[180px_1fr] sm:gap-4">
            <dt class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-taupe">Postal address</dt>
            <dd class="text-base text-ink-soft">{legal.direccion}</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-1 py-4 sm:grid-cols-[180px_1fr] sm:gap-4">
            <dt class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-taupe">Contact email</dt>
            <dd class="text-base text-ink-soft">
              <a href={`mailto:${legal.email}`} class="underline decoration-line underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-clay">
                {legal.email}
              </a>
            </dd>
          </div>
        </dl>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-ink sm:text-3xl" style="font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 72;">
          2. Purposes of processing
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
          The personal data that the User provides through the contact channels
          available on the Website (WhatsApp, email or booking via Calendly)
          will be processed for the following purposes:
        </p>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-base text-ink-soft">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="mt-2 inline-block h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-shrink-0 rounded-full bg-clay"></span>
            <span>Handling enquiries, requests and session bookings.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="mt-2 inline-block h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-shrink-0 rounded-full bg-clay"></span>
            <span>Managing the professional relationship between {legal.titular} and the User.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="mt-2 inline-block h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-shrink-0 rounded-full bg-clay"></span>
            <span>Complying with applicable legal, accounting and tax obligations.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-ink sm:text-3xl" style="font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 72;">
          3. Legal basis for processing
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
          The legal basis that legitimises the processing of the User's personal
          data is:
        </p>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-base text-ink-soft">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="mt-2 inline-block h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-shrink-0 rounded-full bg-clay"></span>
            <span>
              <strong class="text-ink">The consent</strong> of the data subject
              when voluntarily making contact through the available channels
              (Art. 6.1.a GDPR).
            </span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="mt-2 inline-block h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-shrink-0 rounded-full bg-clay"></span>
            <span>
              <strong class="text-ink">The performance of a contract</strong> or
              pre-contractual measures in the case of the provision of services
              (Art. 6.1.b GDPR).
            </span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="mt-2 inline-block h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-shrink-0 rounded-full bg-clay"></span>
            <span>
              <strong class="text-ink">Compliance with legal obligations</strong> (Art. 6.1.c GDPR).
            </span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-ink sm:text-3xl" style="font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 72;">
          4. Retention period
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
          Personal data will be kept for as long as necessary to fulfil the
          purpose for which it was collected and to determine any liabilities
          that may arise from that purpose and from the processing of the data.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
          Data related to accounting and tax obligations will be kept for the
          legally established periods (a minimum of six years, according to the
          Spanish Commercial Code).
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-ink sm:text-3xl" style="font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 72;">
          5. Recipients and international transfers
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
          No data will be transferred to third parties, except by legal
          obligation. However, when the User uses third-party services to make
          contact (WhatsApp, Calendly), their data will be processed by the
          providers of those platforms in accordance with their respective
          privacy policies:
        </p>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-base text-ink-soft">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="mt-2 inline-block h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-shrink-0 rounded-full bg-clay"></span>
            <span>
              <strong class="text-ink">WhatsApp / Meta Platforms Ireland Ltd.</strong>{' '}
              <a href="https://www.whatsapp.com/legal/privacy-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="underline decoration-line underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-clay">
                Privacy policy
              </a>
            </span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="mt-2 inline-block h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-shrink-0 rounded-full bg-clay"></span>
            <span>
              <strong class="text-ink">Calendly LLC (USA).</strong>{' '}
              <a href="https://calendly.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="underline decoration-line underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-clay">
                Privacy policy
              </a>{' '}
              — international transfer covered by the EU-US Data Privacy
              Framework.
            </span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-ink sm:text-3xl" style="font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 72;">
          6. Rights of the data subject
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
          The User may exercise the following rights at any time:
        </p>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-base text-ink-soft">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="mt-2 inline-block h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-shrink-0 rounded-full bg-clay"></span>
            <span>Access to their personal data.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="mt-2 inline-block h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-shrink-0 rounded-full bg-clay"></span>
            <span>Rectification of inaccurate data.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="mt-2 inline-block h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-shrink-0 rounded-full bg-clay"></span>
            <span>Erasure ("right to be forgotten").</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="mt-2 inline-block h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-shrink-0 rounded-full bg-clay"></span>
            <span>Restriction of processing.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="mt-2 inline-block h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-shrink-0 rounded-full bg-clay"></span>
            <span>Data portability.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="mt-2 inline-block h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-shrink-0 rounded-full bg-clay"></span>
            <span>Objection to processing.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="mt-2 inline-block h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-shrink-0 rounded-full bg-clay"></span>
            <span>Withdrawal of consent at any time.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
          To exercise these rights, the User may write to {legal.titular}, at
          the address {legal.direccion}, or to the email address{' '}
          <a href={`mailto:${legal.email}`} class="underline decoration-line underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-clay">
            {legal.email}
          </a>
          , indicating "Data Protection" as the subject and proving their
          identity.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
          The User also has the right to lodge a complaint with the competent
          supervisory authority: the{' '}
          <a href="https://www.aepd.es" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="underline decoration-line underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-clay">
            Spanish Data Protection Agency (AEPD)
          </a>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-ink sm:text-3xl" style="font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 72;">
          7. Cookie Policy
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
          This Website <strong class="text-ink">does not use its own or
          third-party cookies</strong> for analytical, advertising or tracking
          purposes. Nor are any tools used to analyse User behaviour (such as
          Google Analytics, Meta Pixel, etc.).
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
          The typefaces (Fraunces and Geist Sans) are served locally from the
          server itself, without connecting to external CDNs.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
          If the User decides to visit an external link (WhatsApp, Calendly),
          those platforms may use their own cookies in accordance with their
          respective policies.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-ink sm:text-3xl" style="font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 72;">
          8. Security measures
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
          {legal.titular} has adopted the technical and organisational measures
          necessary to ensure the security of personal data and prevent its
          alteration, loss, unauthorised processing or access, in line with the
          state of technology and the nature of the data processed.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-ink sm:text-3xl" style="font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 72;">
          9. Changes to the privacy policy
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
          {legal.titular} reserves the right to modify this policy to adapt it
          to legislative or case-law developments. In such cases, any changes
          introduced will be announced on the Website with reasonable notice
          before they take effect.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>

    <p class="mt-12 text-xs text-taupe">
      Last updated: {legal.fechaActualizacion}
    </p>
  </article>
</Layout>
